epared to successfully enter the workforce. Learn More Opens in a new tab Career Readiness for International Students Equip yourself with tools to succeed in the Canadian labour market. Learn More Opens in a new tab Equity Resources Career Hub strongly believes in equipping and empowering the Algoma University students and new graduates from diverse backgrounds and setting them up for success. Here you will find a variety of informational resources to succeed in your careers and empower you to uphold your unique identity. Learn More Opens in a new tab Devant Are you an international student and are looking for career preparation support? Sign up for Devant! Learn More Login Support LinkedIn Learning Gain access to an array of free Career Development trainings. Sign up now using your Algoma University credentials. Learn More Login Support Experiential Learning To learn more about experiential learning and upcoming workshops, visit our Experiential Learning page. Learn More Algoma Connect Program Career Link is proud to support the Algoma Connect Program. Learn more about how you can get involved. Learn More Ten Thousand Coffees The Algoma University Café is a networking and mentorship platform that connects students, alumni and business professionals based on their role, career goals, and professional interests. Learn More Facebook Instagram Twitter YouTube LinkedIn Special Mission Campus Safety Calendar Latest News Giving Careers Privacy Accessibility 1520 Queen Street East Sault Ste. Marie, Ontario Canada P6A 2G4 24 Queen St. East (A-101 Welcome Centre) Brampton, Ontario Canada L6V 1A3 Tel: 1-888-Algoma-U (1-888-254-6628) Info@algomau.ca Copyright © 2026 Algoma University. All Rights Reserved. Future. Focused. Sign up to learn more about what sets Algoma apart and to get application advice sent right to your inbox. All fields opposite are required to submit your interest. [gravityform id=\"11\" title=\"false\" description=\"false\" ajax=\"true\"] This website uses 