      "description": "Job Boards - Algoma University Winter Weather Alert: Algoma University’s Sault Ste. Marie Campus CLOSED, Monday, March 16, 2026. All in-person classes are cancelled. Please monitor weather conditions and use caution when travelling to, from, or on campus . See more Skip to content Special Mission Alumni Overview Alumni Ambassador Program Alumni Events Alumni Awards Alumni Magazine Update Your Information Online Clothing Store Alumni Benefits & Services News Giving Calendar Contact Campus Safety Overview Anti-hate/Anti-racism Sexual Violence Prevention Health and Safety AU Safe App Resources Academic Calendar Gallery Cost Calculator Careers People and Culture Health & Safety Wellness Finance and Planning IT Services Marketing & Communications Privacy at Algoma U Physical Plant Services Policies and Procedures Public Disclosure Documents Faculty Resources Jump To Student Portal Employee Portal Course Schedules Sault Ste. Marie Campus Brampton Campus Timmins Campus Wishart Library Bookstore & Supplies Thunderbirds Athletics Algoma U Shop Students Close Overview Future Students Close Overview Future Student Events Apply Now Facebook Instagram Twitter YouTube LinkedIn New Students Close Overview Certificate Students College Transfer Students First Year Domestic Students Orientation Facebook Instagram Twitter YouTube LinkedIn Current Students International Students Close Overview Admissions Requirements Homestay Services International Partnerships Health Insurance International Scholarships Study Abroad Pre-Orientation Success and Wellbeing Facebook Instagram Twitter YouTube LinkedIn Anishinaabe Students Close Overview Shingwauk Anishinaabe Students Association Anishinaabe Peoples’ Council Shingwauk Kinoomaage Gamig Partnership Facebook Instagram Twitter YouTube LinkedIn Housing Close Overview GTA (Brampton and Mississauga) Sault Ste. Marie Timmins Facebook Instagram Twitter YouTube LinkedIn Student Accounts Student Life Clubs & Associations Close Ov